        "description": "Use only after the user explicitly approved this job_id. Requires status pending_approval or awaiting_approval and approval_status pending. Sets approval_status approved and status queued, then publishes the job id to Service Bus. Never call this automatically immediately after PrepareFirewallJob. The worker refuses any job that is not approved and queued."
